# Canonicalize the domain to a single hop: any http:// or www. request
# goes straight to https://onlinedigitalfortress.com/ in one redirect,
# instead of bouncing through an intermediate step first.
http://www.onlinedigitalfortress.com/*   https://onlinedigitalfortress.com/:splat   301!
https://www.onlinedigitalfortress.com/*  https://onlinedigitalfortress.com/:splat   301!
http://onlinedigitalfortress.com/*       https://onlinedigitalfortress.com/:splat   301!

/bonus  /bonus.html  200
